            "review_title": "Review at Bia Hoi Viet Ha Dan Hoai",
            "review_text": "Maxim D\nSingapore, Singapore32 contributions\n0\nSecret Hideaway with excellent seafood!\nJul 2020 • Couples\nVery friendly staff and cozy atmosphere with delicios Vietnamese dishes! Great place to chill and have fresh fish steamed or a myriad of local dishes! Hoai and Dan are very kind and can cater to party’s or special events like Vietnam football matches!!\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 22, 2020",
